---
layout: inner.njk
title: "Контакти — Ритеил парк Раковски"
description: "Свържете се с Ритеил парк Раковски. Намерете ни на картата, позвънете ни или напишете имейл."
---

<section class="relative py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">

    {# ── Editorial header ── #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start mb-14 sm:mb-20">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-px w-10 bg-brand-yellow"></span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] uppercase text-brand-yellow">Контакти</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.05]">
          Свържете се
          <span class="block italic font-light text-slate-900">
            <span class="underline decoration-brand-yellow decoration-[3px] underline-offset-[10px]">с нас</span>.
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Имате въпрос, предложение или искате да научите повече? Ние сме тук, за да помогнем — посетете ни или се свържете с нас по удобния за вас начин.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ── Main layout: info cards + map ── #}
    <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-stretch">

      {# Contact info (Za nas text card pattern) #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-[2rem] sm:rounded-[2.5rem] bg-white/92 backdrop-blur-sm flex flex-col p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-900/10 ring-1 ring-white/60">
        <span class="absolute left-10 top-0 h-px w-10 -translate-y-px bg-brand-yellow" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        {# Info items — counter strip style internally #}
        <div class="space-y-7 divide-y divide-slate-100">

          <div class="group relative flex gap-5 pt-0">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-teal/10">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-teal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Адрес</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
                {{ site.footer.address | default('ул. Примерна 1, Раковски, обл. Пловдив') }}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative flex gap-5 pt-7">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-yellow/10">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-yellow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 11.5a19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 012 .82h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 8.66a16 16 0 006.29 6.29l1.21-1.21a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Телефон</p>
              {% set phone = site.footer.phone | default('+359 000 000 000') %}
              <a href="tel:{{ phone | replace(' ', '') }}" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 transition hover:text-brand-teal">{{ phone }}</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative flex gap-5 pt-7">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-teal/10">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-teal" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Имейл</p>
              {% set email = site.footer.email | default('info@parkrakovski.bg') %}
              <a href="mailto:{{ email }}" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 transition hover:text-brand-teal">{{ email }}</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative flex gap-5 pt-7">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-yellow/10">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-brand-yellow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Работно време</p>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
                Пон – Съб: 08:00 – 21:00<br/>
                Неделя: 09:00 – 20:00
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        {# Social icons #}
        <div class="mt-10 pt-7 border-t border-slate-100">
          <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-4">Социални мрежи</p>
          <div class="flex gap-3">
            {% set soc = site.footer.social | default({}) %}
            <a href="{{ soc.facebook | default('#') }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook"
              class="group/icon relative inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-500 shadow-sm transition hover:border-brand-teal hover:text-brand-teal hover:shadow-md">
              <svg class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12c0-5.52-4.48-10-10-10S2 6.48 2 12c0 4.84 3.44 8.87 8 9.8V15H8v-4h2v-1.5C10 8.57 11.57 7 13.5 7H16v4h-2c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1V15h3l-.5 4H13v6.95c4.56-.93 8-4.96 8-9.95z"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="{{ soc.instagram | default('#') }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram"
              class="group/icon relative inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-500 shadow-sm transition hover:border-brand-teal hover:text-brand-teal hover:shadow-md">
              <svg class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zM5.838 12a6.162 6.162 0 1112.324 0 6.162 6.162 0 01-12.324 0zm12.406-7.845a1.44 1.44 0 11-2.881 0 1.44 1.44 0 012.881 0zM12 9.838a2.162 2.162 0 100 4.324 2.162 2.162 0 000-4.324z"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="{{ soc.youtube | default('#') }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube"
              class="group/icon relative inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-500 shadow-sm transition hover:border-brand-teal hover:text-brand-teal hover:shadow-md">
              <svg class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.8 8.001a2.2 2.2 0 00-1.55-1.56C18.2 6 12 6 12 6s-6.2 0-7.25.44A2.2 2.2 0 002.2 8v8a2.2 2.2 0 001.55 1.56C5.8 18 12 18 12 18s6.2 0 7.25-.44A2.2 2.2 0 0021.8 16V8zM10 15V9l5 3-5 3z"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# Map card (image card pattern) #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 rounded-[2rem] sm:rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-slate-900/15 ring-1 ring-white/40 min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-[560px]">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2952.3272406567735!2d24.915860275936137!3d42.27153747120129!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x40a9d58ed619e4fb%3A0xd28fac427aa094ed!2sRetail%20Park%20Rakovski!5e0!3m2!1sbg!2sbg!4v1778326640417!5m2!1sbg!2sbg"
          width="100%"
          height="100%"
          style="border:0; display:block; min-height:400px;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="Ритеил парк Раковски на картата"
        ></iframe>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
